","title":"$names = Get-Content -LiteralPath '.env' | Where-Object { $_ -match '^\\s*[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*\\s*=' } | ForEach-Object { ($_ -split '=',2)[0].Trim() }; $names | Sort-Object -Unique","status":"completed","toolCallId":"exec-c8b088c8-e8bf-4c9c-8ed5-69a422cf0ee1","sessionId":"01a0698d-c4d0-7861-993a-91f9cd7f10e5","seq":94365,"startedSeq":94298,"endedSeq":94365,"timestamp":"1788488818Z","raw":{"_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","toolName":null,"toolDetailAvailable":false}}}},{"id":"tool-call-exec-2494e622-2156-4651-a8fb-50e1ab52ed41","kind":"toolCall","title":"rg -n -A 120 -B 10 \"stage2Check|stage2\" build.gradle.kts settings.gradle.kts scripts/collect-stage2-evidence.mjs","status":"completed","toolCallId":"exec-2494e622-2156-4651-a8fb-50e1ab52ed41","sessionId":"01a0698d-c4d0-7861-993a-91f9cd7f10e5","seq":94366,"startedSeq":94299,"endedSeq":94366,"timestamp":"1788488818Z","raw":{"_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","toolName":null,"toolDetailAvailable":false}}}},{"id":"assistant-thought-root-rs_0d66530b87b73b59016a9a2c74a48c87d081de3138b2bca922","kind":"thoughtDelta","sessionId":"01a0698d-c4d0-7861-993a-91f9cd7f10e5","seq":94373,"startedSeq":94368,"endedSeq":94373,"timestamp":"1788488825Z","raw":{"_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","toolName":null,"toolDetailAvailable":false}}},"content":"\n\n**Inspecting stage2 exit and preparing remote cleanup script**\n\n**Designing secure remote SSH command execution**\n\n**Implementing read-only remote script execution**"},{"id":"assistant-message-root-msg_0d66530b87b73b59016a9a2c7e926087d0b3eb234955cb9618","kind":"textDelta","sessionId":"01a0698d-c4d0-7861-993a-91f9cd7f10e5","seq":94474,"startedSeq":94374,"endedSeq":94474,"timestamp":"1788488830Z","raw":{"_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","toolName":null,"toolDetailAvailable":false}}},"content":"阶段 2 的根因与收口方向已经明确：当前不是需要新增第二套状态模型的设计缺陷，而是“正确的 canonical 设计已实现，但文档/API 基线/跨平台证据尚未完整收敛”。我现在先只读核验远端残留的解析路径、属主、卷名和容器状态；确认目标严格位于 JI 专用目录后，再执行可恢复性最低但范围精确的删除。"},{"id":"tool-call-exec-cdf2e159-9fd7-483c-a789-0aada8bf2cd3","kind":"toolCall","title":"$cfg = @{}\nGet-Content -LiteralPath '.env' | ForEach-Object {\n  if ($_ -match '^\\s*([A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*)\\s*=(.*)$') {\n    $cfg[$matches[1]] = $matches[2].Trim().Trim('\"').Trim(\"'\")\n  }\n}\n$sshTarget = $cfg['JI_TEST_SSH_TARGET']\n$sshKey = $cfg['JI_TEST_SSH_KEY']\nif ([string]::IsNullOrWhiteSpace($sshTarget) -or [string]::IsNullOrWhiteSpace($sshKey)) { throw 'SSH test configuration is incomplete' }\nif (-not (Test-Path -LiteralPath $sshKey -PathType Leaf)) { throw 'Configured SSH key file is unavailable' }\n$remoteScript = @'\nset -euo pipefail\ntarget=/home/ubuntu/.ji-stage2-validation/run-001\nresolved=$(realpath -m -- \"$target\")\nif test \"$resolved\" != \"$target\"; then\n  printf 'unsafe_resolved_path\\n' >&2\n  exit 20\nfi\nif test -e \"$resolved\"; then\n  stat -c 'target_present owner=%U:%G type=%F' -- \"$resolved\"\nelse\n  printf 'target_absent\\n'\nfi\nif docker volume inspect ji-stage2-gradle-cache >/dev/null 2>&1; then\n  docker volume inspect ji-stage2-gradle-cache --format 'volume_present name={{.Name}} labels={{json .Labels}}'\nelse\n  printf 'volume_absent\\n'\nfi\ncontainer_count=$(docker ps -a --filter 'name=ji-stage2' --format '{{.ID}}' | wc -l)\nprintf 'ji_stage2_container_count=%s\\n' \"$container_count\"\n'@\n$remoteScript | & ssh -i $sshKey -o BatchMode=yes -o StrictHostKeyChecking=yes -- $sshTarget 'bash -s'\nif ($LASTEXITCODE -ne 0) { throw \"Remote read-only validation failed: $LASTEXITCODE\" }","status":"completed","toolCallId":"exec-cdf2e159-9fd7-483c-a789-0aada8bf2cd3","sessionId":"01a0698d-c4d0-7861-993a-91f9cd7f10e5","seq":94479,"startedSeq":94475,"endedSeq":94479,"timestamp":"1788488841Z","raw":{"_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","toolName":null,"toolDetailAvailable":false}}}},{"id":"assistant-thought-root-rs_0d66530b87b73b59016a9a2c8d04a087d08300837798ba0a86","kind":"thoughtDelta","sessionId":"01a0698d-c4d0-7861-993a-91f9cd7f10e5","seq":94484,"startedSeq":94481,"endedSeq":94484,"timestamp":"1788488848Z","raw":{"_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","toolName":null,"toolDetailAvailable":false}}},"content":"\n\n**Verifying exact file ownership before deletion**\n\n**Planning remote and local volume cleanup**"}]